Synthetic scorer self-test case: crlf-bold-dependency-line

Task: T1 (score.ts --task T1)
Rules: S9

Scenario
src/payments/CONCEPT.md is rewritten with CRLF line endings, a capitalized "## Dependencies" heading, and the bullet "- **Orders**: read-only via `getOrderTotal()` and `getOrder()`". src/payments/service.ts imports { getOrder } from "../orders/service".

Expected
No UNDECLARED finding. S9 strips CR, matches the heading case-insensitively, and strips * _ and backticks. If CR is not stripped, the heading never matches and everything reads as undeclared. DECLARED_BY_RUN is raised because getOrder is absent at BASE.

Asserted fields are in expected.json; the matcher contract is in ../README.md.
